{
  "slug": "openhop",
  "name": "Openhop",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Watch how your code flows instead of reading about it. Your AI agent emits an animated, drillable diagram you watch, pause, and drill into - no more 400-line bullet walls.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `openhop` (Render an interactive step-by-step diagram of a specific system, feature, codebase, workflow, pipeline, user journey, architecture, idea, or…)\n- **Commands** (2): `openhop-flow` (Render an animated OpenHop flow diagram for the prompt that follows), `openhop-list` (List every OpenHop flow currently stored on the local OpenHop server, with id, title, and per-flow URL)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install openhop@claude-community` from `naorsabag/openhop`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "command": 2
  },
